{"id":527,"mal_id":527,"title":"Pokemon","englishTitle":"Pokémon","title_english":"Pokémon","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Pocket Monsters","Indigo League","Adventures on the Orange Islands","The Johto Journeys","Johto League Champions","Master Quest"],"en":"Pokémon","ja":"ポケットモンスター"},"synopsis":"Pokémon are peculiar creatures with a vast array of different abilities and appearances; many people, known as Pokémon trainers, capture and train them, often with the intent of battling others. Young Satoshi has not only dreamed of becoming a Pokémon trainer but also a \"Pokémon Master,\" and on the arrival of his 10th birthday, he finally has a chance to make that dream a reality. Unfortunately for him, all three Pokémon available to beginning trainers have already been claimed and only Pikachu, a rebellious Electric-type Pokémon, remains. However, this chance encounter would mark the start of a lifelong friendship and an epic adventure!\n\nSetting off on a journey to become the very best, Satoshi and Pikachu travel across beautiful, sprawling regions with their friends Kasumi, a Water-type trainer, and Takeshi, a Rock-type trainer. But danger lurks around every corner. The infamous Team Rocket is always nearby, seeking to steal powerful Pokémon through nefarious schemes. It'll be up to Satoshi and his friends to thwart their efforts as he also strives to earn the eight Pokémon Gym Badges he'll need to challenge the Pokémon League, and eventually claim the title of Pokémon Master. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Los Pokémon son criaturas peculiares con una amplia gama de habilidades y apariencias diferentes; Muchas personas, conocidas como entrenadores Pokémon, los capturan y entrenan, a menudo con la intención de luchar contra otros. El joven Satoshi no sólo ha soñado con convertirse en entrenador Pokémon sino también en \"Maestro Pokémon\", y cuando llega su décimo cumpleaños, finalmente tiene la oportunidad de hacer realidad ese sueño. Desafortunadamente para él, los tres Pokémon disponibles para los entrenadores principiantes ya han sido reclamados y sólo queda Pikachu, un Pokémon rebelde de tipo Eléctrico. Sin embargo, este encuentro casual marcaría el comienzo de una amistad para toda la vida y una aventura épica.\n\nEn un viaje para convertirse en los mejores, Satoshi y Pikachu viajan a través de hermosas y extensas regiones con sus amigos Kasumi, un entrenador de tipo Agua, y Takeshi, un entrenador de tipo Roca. Pero el peligro acecha en cada esquina. El infame Equipo Rocket siempre está cerca, buscando robar Pokémon poderosos mediante planes nefastos. Dependerá de Satoshi y sus amigos frustrar sus esfuerzos mientras él también se esfuerza por ganar las ocho Insignias de Gimnasio Pokémon que necesitará para desafiar la Liga Pokémon y, finalmente, reclamar el título de Maestro Pokémon. \n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1440,"average_episode_duration":1440,"startDate":"1997-04-01","start_date":"1997-04-01","endDate":"2002-11-14","end_date":"2002-11-14","season":"spring","year":1997,"start_season":{"year":1997,"season":"spring"},"episodes":276,"num_episodes":276,"score":7.43,"mean":7.43,"numListUsers":693458,"num_list_users":693458,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":2,"name":"Adventure"},{"id":4,"name":"Comedy"},{"id":10,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":15,"name":"Kids"}],"studios":[{"id":28,"name":"OLM"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1787/140239.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1787/140239l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1787/140239.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1787/140239l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1787/140239l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"da